### Health
GET http://localhost:8000/health

### Create account (happy path)
POST http://localhost:8000/api/accounts
Content-Type: application/json

{"owner_name": "Abd", "initial_balance": 500}

### Bad input -> 400
POST http://localhost:8000/api/accounts
Content-Type: application/json

{"owner_name": "", "initial_balance": -10}

### Get by id (paste an id from the create response)
GET http://localhost:8000/api/accounts/REPLACE_ME

### List all accounts
GET http://localhost:8000/api/accounts

### Deposit (happy path) -> 200
POST http://localhost:8000/api/accounts/REPLACE_ME/deposit
Content-Type: application/json

{"amount": 100}

### Deposit negative -> 400
POST http://localhost:8000/api/accounts/REPLACE_ME/deposit
Content-Type: application/json

{"amount": -5}

### Deposit wrong type -> 400
POST http://localhost:8000/api/accounts/REPLACE_ME/deposit
Content-Type: application/json

{"amount": "abc"}

### Deposit to missing account -> 404
POST http://localhost:8000/api/accounts/does-not-exist/deposit
Content-Type: application/json

{"amount": 100}
